== Exercise 5.19: moving coins together
OK   5.19 lemma: walk of length exactly t from u to x <=> t >= shortest walk of t's parity (V >= 2)
OK   5.19(a) two coins: parity formula == brute force over coin configurations  [500 random connected graphs]
OK   5.19(b) three coins: parity formula == brute force
OK   5.19 four coins: parity formula == brute force (sanity check of the general rule)
OK   5.19(c) 42 coins: reachable from all (u_j, 0) <=> non-bipartite or all starts on one side

